1
00:00:00,166 --> 00:00:01,416
Hey, Pen!

2
00:00:01,625 --> 00:00:03,500
Try to jump over that!

3
00:00:05,125 --> 00:00:07,000
See? That was easy!

4
00:00:07,416 --> 00:00:10,791
That was the easiest thing I've ever done!

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,208
Eraser:
Lemme try!

6
00:00:12,458 --> 00:00:13,791
Hunnnruuugh!

7
00:00:13,791 --> 00:00:14,625
Save me, Pen!

8
00:00:14,625 --> 00:00:15,750
- Blocky!
- Firey!

9
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:16,708
- Match!
- Pencil!

10
00:00:16,708 --> 00:00:17,958
- Bubble!
- Leafy!

11
00:00:17,958 --> 00:00:19,041
Icy!

12
00:00:19,041 --> 00:00:20,500
Revenge!

13
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,333
Everyone:
Ahhhhh!

14
00:00:23,083 --> 00:00:29,708
[INTRO PLAYS]

15
00:00:29,708 --> 00:00:30,708
Subtitles: TAFFYMARZI

16
00:00:32,625 --> 00:00:35,458
Announcer:
Match, Ice Cube, Rocky and Tennis Ball.

17
00:00:36,083 --> 00:00:38,833
Last episode, you four had the lowest scores.

18
00:00:39,416 --> 00:00:43,791
The voters have cast their ballots and chosen
which of the four of you will be eliminated.

19
00:00:43,791 --> 00:00:48,500
OMG, I hope none of them voted for good old Match!

20
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:50,833
Well, let's find out at Cake at Stake.

21
00:01:02,750 --> 00:01:05,416
Oh, I'm scared!

22
00:01:05,416 --> 00:01:09,875
This time we got 158 votes. I have 10 slices of cake.

23
00:01:09,875 --> 00:01:13,625
OMG. I see you chose, like, fruitcake for the cake.

24
00:01:13,875 --> 00:01:16,666
That is just totally an awful choice!
I mean, why would you do that?!

25
00:01:16,666 --> 00:01:21,000
Match is right. Nobody like fruit cake! Like...

26
00:01:21,041 --> 00:01:22,000
Shush, sheesh

27
00:01:22,291 --> 00:01:26,083
So there are 10 slices.
They represent your safety in the battle.

28
00:01:26,083 --> 00:01:30,291
At least for now. Whoever does not receive
a slice will be eliminated.

29
00:01:30,291 --> 00:01:33,791
Announcer:
The seven of you who did not
fall into the bottom four are all safe.

30
00:01:34,666 --> 00:01:36,833
Now there are only three slices left.

31
00:01:37,333 --> 00:01:40,375
Announcer:
Ice Cube, with only 9 votes, you are safe.

32
00:01:41,083 --> 00:01:44,708
Announcer:
Tennis Ball, even with 34 votes, you are safe.

33
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,041
Yaaayrrr!

34
00:01:47,083 --> 00:01:49,125
There is only one slice of cake left.

35
00:01:51,916 --> 00:01:53,291
I will now show the votes.

36
00:02:02,750 --> 00:02:06,708
No, Match, no! You've been eliminated!

37
00:02:06,708 --> 00:02:11,916
OMG, I know it's so, like, hard,
but you got to keep, like, like, going!

38
00:02:11,916 --> 00:02:15,083
You've got to win this for, like, like, like, like, the both of us!

39
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:18,125
You murdered her!

40
00:02:18,125 --> 00:02:21,625
No, that was our Laser Powered Teleportation Device.

41
00:02:22,166 --> 00:02:24,833
It teleported Match into the Tiny Loser Chamber.

42
00:02:29,041 --> 00:02:32,875
Oh no, Bubble! What'll we do with Match gone!?

43
00:02:32,875 --> 00:02:34,500
Ooh, I don't know.

44
00:02:34,666 --> 00:02:39,875
- Hey guys, can I be part…
- You know what? Sure. You CAN be part of our alliance.

45
00:02:40,208 --> 00:02:41,833
The more friends the better, right?

46
00:02:41,833 --> 00:02:46,541
Match will sure be angry
when she finds out we replaced her!

47
00:02:46,541 --> 00:02:51,333
Oh, silly, Bubble! We haven't
replaced her, we… substituted her!

48
00:02:51,333 --> 00:02:53,208
People, people. Be quiet.

49
00:02:53,416 --> 00:02:56,375
So as you know, you are the final 10 contestants.

50
00:02:56,375 --> 00:02:58,375
That means you've reached the halfway mark.

51
00:02:58,375 --> 00:02:59,916
Everyone:
Yeah!

52
00:02:59,916 --> 00:03:00,916
You all get a reward.

53
00:03:00,916 --> 00:03:03,541
Another reward? I love rewards!

54
00:03:03,541 --> 00:03:05,708
Announcer:
You each get half of a pair of scissors.

55
00:03:05,708 --> 00:03:07,291
What!? What good is this?

56
00:03:07,291 --> 00:03:10,541
Get it? It's HALF of something that can cut things in HALF.

57
00:03:10,541 --> 00:03:13,041
Because you've all reached the HALFway mark.

58
00:03:13,041 --> 00:03:15,500
Ah, ha, huh…

59
00:03:15,791 --> 00:03:18,208
But your competition is about get larger.

60
00:03:18,208 --> 00:03:20,250
Oh, no, you don't mean…

61
00:03:20,250 --> 00:03:21,333
Oh, yes I do.

62
00:03:21,916 --> 00:03:26,958
Announcer:
Just like there are 10 contestants still in,
there are 10 contestants who've been eliminated.

63
00:03:27,416 --> 00:03:29,041
Announcer:
One will rejoin the game.

64
00:03:29,041 --> 00:03:29,916
Everyone:
Gasp!

65
00:03:29,916 --> 00:03:31,750
So how do I re-enter the game?

66
00:03:31,750 --> 00:03:35,333
Well, you may have noticed that there is a
basket behind each of you.

67
00:03:35,708 --> 00:03:38,708
Announcer:
There is also a large basket filled with loaves of bread.

68
00:03:39,208 --> 00:03:41,666
When this hourglass runs out, whoever has

69
00:03:41,666 --> 00:03:45,083
the most loaves of bread in their individual
basket re-enters the game.

70
00:03:45,875 --> 00:03:46,291
Go.

71
00:03:46,291 --> 00:03:48,916
YAAAAAAAAH!

72
00:03:48,916 --> 00:03:49,625
Errroph!

73
00:03:50,625 --> 00:03:52,541
Flower is ahead with 4 loaves.

74
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:56,500
Announcer:
Snowball, Coiny, Needle and Match are just behind her.

75
00:03:56,500 --> 00:03:58,458
Yeah! Match, you GOT this!

76
00:03:59,916 --> 00:04:00,416
Yeah!

77
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,791
Pin is now ahead with 5.

78
00:04:04,083 --> 00:04:04,875
Flower at 7.

79
00:04:06,125 --> 00:04:07,791
Announcer:
Snowball beating her at 8.

80
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:11,125
Announcer:
Golf Ball, Spongy and Woody still at zero.

81
00:04:11,416 --> 00:04:13,125
Now Woody is taking his first dump.

82
00:04:16,083 --> 00:04:17,208
Pin is at 9 now.

83
00:04:18,833 --> 00:04:20,916
Flower and Snowball both at 11.

84
00:04:21,166 --> 00:04:23,666
Ruhh... ruhh.. ruhh.. rrreh!

85
00:04:24,375 --> 00:04:28,750
Woah! Spongy is actually bringing in a
dozen loaves at once! He is now in the lead.

86
00:04:28,958 --> 00:04:30,250
What?! That's crazy!

87
00:04:30,458 --> 00:04:33,958
Oh no! I'm drowning! HERRRR... [mumbles]

88
00:04:33,958 --> 00:04:34,791
Ha, ha!

89
00:04:36,166 --> 00:04:37,250
Needle is at 12.

90
00:04:37,583 --> 00:04:38,660
Match is at 13.

91
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,250
Pin is at 14.

92
00:04:40,500 --> 00:04:41,875
Announcer:
Flower is at 15.

93
00:04:41,875 --> 00:04:46,166
Announcer:
Snowball in the lead with 16. Golf Ball now at 1.

94
00:04:46,166 --> 00:04:48,625
Yeah! Go, Golf Ball!

95
00:04:49,208 --> 00:04:50,208
Time's half up.

96
00:04:50,750 --> 00:04:52,333
Eh, eh...

97
00:04:52,625 --> 00:04:54,541
Ha, ha! Woody's drowning as well.

98
00:04:54,750 --> 00:04:56,333
Hey! Drowning is not funny.

99
00:04:56,333 --> 00:04:57,958
Announcer:
Snowball has 20 loaves.

100
00:04:58,583 --> 00:05:00,416
Announcer:
Flower and Pin both at 18...

101
00:05:01,083 --> 00:05:03,041
Announcer:
...and Needle and Golf Ball are drowning.

102
00:05:03,333 --> 00:05:07,833
Announcer:
Seriously, why are so many people drowning?
It's not quicksand or anything.

103
00:05:11,250 --> 00:05:15,291
Announcer:
Spongy brings in a baker's dozen this time,
raising him to first place.

104
00:05:15,458 --> 00:05:16,750
What? That's crazy!

105
00:05:17,083 --> 00:05:20,583
OMG, Match, go fast! Fast! Fast!

106
00:05:20,666 --> 00:05:21,333
Okay!

107
00:05:21,708 --> 00:05:22,208
Oof!

108
00:05:24,291 --> 00:05:24,833
Woah!

109
00:05:26,458 --> 00:05:28,625
Pin's evil strategy brings her into first.

110
00:05:30,291 --> 00:05:31,416
Announcer:
Flower is in second.

111
00:05:31,833 --> 00:05:37,000
Bleh! Bleh! Bleh! Bleh!
Bleh! Bleh! Bleh! Bleh!

112
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:39,291
Blehblehblehblehblehblehblehbleh!

113
00:05:39,291 --> 00:05:42,083
Announcer:
Snowball is tied with Pin for the lead.

114
00:05:42,083 --> 00:05:44,125
Pen, Eraser, and Blocky:
Yeah! Go, Snowball!

115
00:05:44,125 --> 00:05:45,375
Time is almost up.

116
00:05:46,125 --> 00:05:46,708
Announcer:
Five...

117
00:05:47,250 --> 00:05:47,791
Announcer:
Four...

118
00:05:48,208 --> 00:05:48,500
Announcer:
Three...

119
00:05:48,500 --> 00:05:49,291
BLEHBLEHBLEHBLEHBLEHBLEH!

120
00:05:49,291 --> 00:05:49,750
Announcer:
Two...

121
00:05:50,333 --> 00:05:50,666
Announcer:
One...

122
00:05:50,666 --> 00:05:51,333
Spongy:
Reaauuuh!

123
00:05:51,333 --> 00:05:55,458
Boop, time's up. Well, Spongy is actually at first.

124
00:05:55,458 --> 00:05:56,583
Yay!

125
00:05:57,375 --> 00:05:58,625
- Pencil: Augh, ew!
- Bubble: Disgusting!
- Ice Cube: Aw!

126
00:05:59,833 --> 00:06:01,416
Welcome back, Spongy.

127
00:06:01,625 --> 00:06:02,250
Moving on,

128
00:06:02,875 --> 00:06:07,166
on this screen, I will display your
scores from highest to lowest.

129
00:06:08,125 --> 00:06:09,791
Yeah, still at the top!

130
00:06:13,083 --> 00:06:15,875
Aww, what about me?

131
00:06:15,958 --> 00:06:20,583
In the Bread Loaf contest, you got 38 loaves of bread,
so your score is 38.

132
00:06:22,083 --> 00:06:27,666
Last episode, our screen was acting strangely.
I think we've got it all figured out now.

133
00:06:28,291 --> 00:06:32,125
Sorry, I forgot. So who is gonna be up for elimination?

134
00:06:32,958 --> 00:06:38,375
Well, at the end of this episode, the 4 people
with the lowest scores will be up for elimination.

135
00:06:38,916 --> 00:06:41,666
Wow, I would not like to fall in to the Bottom 4.

136
00:06:41,666 --> 00:06:46,458
No, you would not. Having said that,
who wants 15 bonus points?

137
00:06:46,666 --> 00:06:49,958
- Firey: Give it to me! I need it! I need it so badly!
- Eraser: Ooooh! Me! ME! Give it to me!
- Pen: ME!

138
00:06:50,458 --> 00:06:51,875
Here's my marble collection.

139
00:06:54,625 --> 00:07:00,000
You'll get 15 points if you manage to
retrieve it in this 10-foot deep vat of hydrochloric acid.

140
00:07:08,291 --> 00:07:10,958
Good thing I have my magnet!

141
00:07:11,541 --> 00:07:13,541
Announcer:
Tennis Ball gets the 15 points.

142
00:07:17,458 --> 00:07:19,125
Yaaaay!

143
00:07:19,541 --> 00:07:20,125
Moving on,

144
00:07:20,791 --> 00:07:23,541
I want to make BFDI as fair as possible.

145
00:07:24,166 --> 00:07:28,750
I think that armless people have a disadvantage,
so they get 10 sympathy points.

146
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:30,833
- Tennis Ball: Yaaaay!
- Rocky: Bleh!
- Ice Cube: Wow!
- Spongy: Yaaaaay!

147
00:07:34,500 --> 00:07:36,125
Don't even think about it, Eraser.

148
00:07:36,375 --> 00:07:38,166
Time for the 14th contest.

149
00:07:38,166 --> 00:07:39,500
Which is...?

150
00:07:39,500 --> 00:07:41,166
Hey! That's my line!

151
00:07:41,166 --> 00:07:42,541
Announcer:
Jump over the hurdles.

152
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:45,791
Every hurdle you jump over earns you 5 points.

153
00:07:46,375 --> 00:07:46,833
Go.

154
00:07:48,791 --> 00:07:50,583
Eraser:
Ahhhh!

155
00:07:50,583 --> 00:07:53,458
If you fall like Eraser did, you're out of the challenge.

156
00:07:53,625 --> 00:07:56,125
Oh no! The next one is even higher!

157
00:07:57,083 --> 00:07:59,666
Pen and Firey:
Ahhhh!

158
00:07:59,666 --> 00:08:02,250
So, how is it going, Spongy? Nice to be back?

159
00:08:02,250 --> 00:08:03,125
Yes!

160
00:08:03,791 --> 00:08:05,666
- Spongy: Auuuugh!
- Leafy: Ahhhh!

161
00:08:05,666 --> 00:08:08,416
Oh no! Look at the next one!

162
00:08:09,958 --> 00:08:11,208
Wheeeee!

163
00:08:12,916 --> 00:08:14,310
Alliance power!

164
00:08:18,625 --> 00:08:20,291
[SLOWED DOWN]
- Pencil: Ahhhhh!

165
00:08:20,291 --> 00:08:22,125
[SLOWED DOWN]
- Pencil: Ahhhhh!
- Ice Cube: Ahhhhh!

166
00:08:22,500 --> 00:08:25,541
[SPEEDS UP TO NORMAL SPEED]
Oh no! Look at the next one!

167
00:08:26,708 --> 00:08:27,166
Huah!

168
00:08:27,250 --> 00:08:27,750
Oooh!

169
00:08:28,916 --> 00:08:34,833
Bleheh-leh-leh-leh-leh-leh-leh-leh-leh-leh-leh-leh!

170
00:08:34,958 --> 00:08:36,500
Spectacular vomit art.

171
00:08:36,875 --> 00:08:39,583
Oh no! Look at the next one!

172
00:08:39,750 --> 00:08:41,166
That's enough, Bubble...

173
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:43,847
...although, you may have a point.

174
00:08:44,458 --> 00:08:44,833
Hop!

175
00:08:45,833 --> 00:08:46,958
Okay, I give up.

176
00:08:47,666 --> 00:08:50,791
And that's it. Now let's tally up the scores.

177
00:08:57,500 --> 00:09:02,833
Ice Cube, Leafy, Eraser and Firey,
you have fallen to the bottom 4.

178
00:09:02,833 --> 00:09:05,291
So the voting will only be between the 4 of you.

179
00:09:05,291 --> 00:09:06,458
Ice Cube, Leafy, Eraser, and Firey:
What?

180
00:09:06,541 --> 00:09:10,041
Voters, subscribers, viewers and everyone else out there,

181
00:09:10,041 --> 00:09:13,750
Announcer:
choose who do you think should be
eliminated from the Battle for Dream Island.

182
00:09:23,041 --> 00:09:26,250
[MUFFLED]
Coiny: Pin, do you think they'll ever get us out of here?

183
00:09:26,250 --> 00:09:27,000
[MUFFLED]
Pin: I don't know!

184
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:29,500
[MUFFLED]
Coiny:
Do you think they'll get us out, Needy?

185
00:09:29,833 --> 00:09:32,208
[MUFFLED]
Needle: DON'T CALL ME NEEDY! BUT NO!

186
00:09:32,208 --> 00:09:34,875
[MUFFLED]
Golf Ball: I disagree! They're definitely gonna get us out!

187
00:09:34,875 --> 00:09:36,750
[MUFFLED]
Woody: [CRYING]

188
00:09:36,750 --> 00:09:37,750
[MUFFLED]
Golf Ball: Shut up, Woody!